// wins over `routingGenerated`, so this file can be regenerated without losing the override.
//
// sourceHash covers the text that DEFINES the entry: description/capabilities/tags/tools for an
// agent, and additionally task/allowedAgents, which is where a scene's behaviour actually lives.
// A mismatch means the catalog moved after labelling and the label may be stale.
